- @psl_p_scout: Convice the PSL-P to support <span style="color: #C62828;">Ignacy Daszyński</span>
- @bmn_scout: Convince the BMN to support <span style="color: #C62828;">Ignacy Daszyński</span>
- @viewscout: View party endorsements.
- @scoutdone: We have concluded negotiating with other parties.

