Dawg stop cheating 💔 

@psl_l_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.psl_l_relation >= 70) {
    Q.daszynski_votes += Q.psl_l_pres_votes;
    
    Q.narutowicz_votes -= Q.psl_l_pres_votes;

    Q.psl_l_choice = 'Daszynski';
   }
!}

[? if psl_l_relation >= 70 : They're convinced! They have dropped their support behind Narutowicz and will now support <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span>. ?][? if psl_l_relation < 70 : We are unable to convince them, We can't win this election alone, we need support from other parties. ?]


@psl_w_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.psl_w_relation >= 70 && Q.narutowicz_votes > Q.daszynski_votes) {
    Q.daszynski_votes += Q.psl_w_pres_votes;
    
    Q.narutowicz_votes -= Q.psl_w_pres_votes;

    Q.psl_w_choice = 'Daszynski';
   }
!}

[? if psl_w_relation >= 70 and narutowicz_votes > wojciechowski_votes : They're convinced! They will support <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span>. ?][? if psl_w_relation < 70 and daszynski_votes <= narutowicz_votes : They aren't convinced. Our relationship with them is quite poor and they know that they are more popular than us, We can't win this election alone, we need support from other parties. ?]

@psl_p_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.psl_p_relation >= 70 && Q.daszynski_votes > Q.wojciechowski_votes) {
    Q.daszynski_votes += Q.psl_p_pres_votes;
    Q.daszynski_votes += Q.npr_pres_votes;
    
    Q.wojciechowski_votes -= Q.psl_p_pres_votes;
    Q.wojciechowski_votes -= Q.npr_pres_votes;

    Q.psl_p_choice = 'Daszynski';
    Q.npr_choice = 'Daszynski';

    Q.peasants_psl_p -= 4;
    Q.petit_psl_p -= 3;
    Q.peasants_zln += 3;
   }
!}

[? if psl_p_relation >= 70 and daszynski_votes > wojciechowski_votes : They're convinced! They will support <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span>, They have also convinced the NPR to support our candidate. ?][? if psl_p_relation < 70 and daszynski_votes <= wojciechowski_votes : They aren't convinced. They know they are more popular than us, additionally, socialism is currently unpopular so supporting a socialist candidate may be harmful to their conservative agrarian bases. We can't win this election alone, we need support from other parties. ?]

@bmn_scout
max-visits: 1
go-to: scouting

The BMN delegates have respectfully declined supporting <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span> in the first round as a show of solidarity for minorities. perhaps we can convince them after they have dropped or after we've moved to the second round.

@scoutdone
on-arrival: round += 1; bmn_choice = 'Scatter'; courtenay_votes -= bmn_pres_votes; wojciechowski_votes += bmn_pres_votes*.5; narutowicz_votes += bmn_pres_votes*.5

The first round of voting has concluded.

**<span style="color: #C62828;">Ignacy Daszyński</span>**: [? if daszynski_dropped == 0 : [+ daszynski_votes +]% ?][? if daszynski_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

**Gabriel Narutowicz**:  [? if narutowicz_dropped == 0 : [+ narutowicz_votes +]% ?][? if narutowicz_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

**<span style="color: #3A6538;">Stanisław Wojciechowski</span>**: [? if wojciechowski_dropped == 0 : [+ wojciechowski_votes +]% ?][? if wojciechowski_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

**<span style="color: #E3AF34;">Baudouin de Courtenay</span>**: [? if courtenay_dropped == 0 : [+ courtenay_votes +]% ?] [? if courtenay_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

**<span style="color: #302060;">Maurycy Zamoyski</span>**: [? if zamoyski_dropped == 0 : [+ zamoyski_votes +]% ?][? if zamoyski_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

The BMN has shown an outstanding result on the first round of the presidential election, the minorities have been emboldened by this show of strength, now, they must still face the reality that <span style="color: #E3AF34;">Courtenay</span> cannot win on his own, the <span style="color: #E3AF34;">Minority Bloc</span> has scattered to support the centrist candidate which are Narutowicz and <span style="color: #3A6538;">Wojciechowski</span> to ensure that the center candidates move through the last round. Perhaps we can convince them to support <span style="color: #C62828;">Daszyński</span>?

- @secondround: Let us prepare for the second round.

@secondround

We still need to solidify our votes, we need the help of other parties

- @bmn_scout2: Convince the BMN to support <span style="color: #C62828;">Ignacy Daszyński</span>
- @dropout: Drop out of the Presidential Election and support Narutowicz
- @viewscout: View party endorsements.
- @scoutdone2: We have concluded negotiating with other parties.

@dropout
go-to: secondround
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.daszynski_votes -= Q.daszynski_votes;
Q.narutowicz_votes += Q.pps_pres_votes;

Q.workers_pps -= 2;

if (Q.psl_w_choice != 'Narutowicz') {
    Q.psl_w_choice = 'Narutowicz';
    Q.npr_choice = 'Narutowicz';
    Q.narutowicz_votes += Q.psl_w_pres_votes;
    Q.narutowicz_votes += Q.npr_pres_votes;

    Q.left_dissent += 8;
    Q.center_dissent += 5;
    Q.reformist_dissent += 5;
    Q.conservative_dissent += 8;
    Q.workers_pps -= 2;
    Q.peasants_pps -= 4;
   }

if (Q.psl_l_choice == 'Daszynski') {
    Q.psl_l_choice = 'Narutowicz';
    Q.narutowicz_votes += Q.psl_l_pres_votes;
   }

if (Q.psl_p_choice == 'Daszynski') {
    Q.psl_p_choice = 'Wojciechowski';
    Q.wojciechowski_votes += Q.psl_p_pres_votes;
    Q.psl_p_relation -= 5;
   }

if (Q.bmn_choice == 'ScatterDaszynski') {
    Q.wojciechowski_votes += Q.bmn_pres_votes*.17;
    Q.narutowicz_votes += Q.bmn_pres_votes*.16;
    Q.daszynski_votes -= Q.bmn_pres_votes*.33;
   }
!}

[? if psl_w_choice != 'Narutowicz' : This is unprecedented! despite recieving support from the PSL-W and with Narutowicz declining to stand, we ?][? if psl_w_choice = 'Narutowicz' : We ?] have decided to dropout of the election and instead support Narutowicz against the right[? if psl_w_choice = 'Narutowicz' : . ?][? if psl_w_choice != 'Narutowicz' : ? Our party is displeased about our shift in support, our voter base will be displeased. ?]

@bmn_scout2
go-to: secondround
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.bmn_relation >= 60 && Q.minority_policy > 1) {
    Q.daszynski_votes += Q.bmn_pres_votes*.33;
    Q.wojciechowski_votes -= Q.bmn_pres_votes*.17;
    Q.narutowicz_votes -= Q.bmn_pres_votes*.16;

    Q.bmn_choice = 'ScatterDaszynski';
   }
!}

[? if bmn_relation < 60 : ... ?] [? if minority_policy < 1 : ... ?][? if bmn_relation >= 60 and minority_policy > 1 : ... ?]

@scoutdone2
on-arrival: round += 1
The second round of voting has concluded.

**<span style="color: #C62828;">Ignacy Daszyński</span>**: [? if daszynski_dropped == 0 : [+ daszynski_votes +]% ?][? if daszynski_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

**Gabriel Narutowicz**:  [? if narutowicz_dropped == 0 : [+ narutowicz_votes +]% ?][? if narutowicz_dropped == 1 : Dropped Out ?]

